WEBVTT

00:04:28.345 --> 00:04:31.759
Companies look at just their platform.

00:04:31.783 --> 00:04:34.487
And whatever data they learn along the way

00:04:34.511 --> 00:04:36.513
is rarely shared.

00:04:37.402 --> 00:04:43.003
It is so clear that this
disconnected approach is not working.

00:04:43.643 --> 00:04:47.753
We have to redesign
our response to this epidemic

00:04:47.777 --> 00:04:49.299
for the digital age.

00:04:49.702 --> 00:04:52.644
And that's exactly
what we're doing at Thorn.

00:04:53.311 --> 00:04:56.928
We're building the technology
to connect these dots,

00:04:56.952 --> 00:04:59.274
to arm everyone on the front lines --

00:04:59.298 --> 00:05:02.122
law enforcement, NGOs and companies --